      "created_at": "2014-09-17T00:27:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Do the Sentinels each count for a hero toward the \"H\" count, or do they collectively still count as one? It wouldn't make sense to scale the villians that much despite having four playable hero character cards, but I just wanted to clarify.</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
