      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "They do count as four hero [i]targets[/i], though. If something hits all hero targets, they all get hit. If something hits all [i]heroes[/i], only one of them will (your choice). If they didn&#39;t count as a single hero then stuff like Plague Rat&#39;s flip mechanic would be messed up (because he&#39;d never be able to Infect everyone).\n",
